{
  "id": "run-comparison",
  "title": {
    "zh": "运行比较",
    "en": "Run comparison"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": "选两到八条运行并标记基线、消融或其他方案，逐行对照数据划分、环境与预处理、配置与训练预算、检查点、种子、评估集合、代码来源与统计方法；不同与未知分别标出。只有确认同口径、数值和单位一致时才给出指定方向的差值，单位不换算、多组种子不当单次值、零基线不给相对变化，也不排名。",
    "en": "Pick two to eight runs and mark baseline, ablation or other; compare datasets, environment and preprocessing, configuration and budget, checkpoints, seeds, evaluation sets, code source and statistical method, with differences and unknowns marked. A delta in the chosen direction appears only after you confirm the protocol, values and units match; units are never converted, multi-seed means are not treated as single values, zero baselines get no relative change, and nothing is ranked."
  },
  "author": "dsh-scholar-board",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "sizes": [
    "m",
    "l"
  ],
  "source": "widget-board:records",
  "capabilities": [
    "widget-board:records.read",
    "widget-board:records.open"
  ],
  "defaultBox": {
    "w": 2,
    "h": 30
  },
  "minBox": {
    "w": 1,
    "h": 16
  },
  "scripts": [
    "compare-model.js",
    "copy.js",
    "main.js"
  ],
  "props": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "title": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 80
      },
      "kicker": {
        "type": "string",
        "maxLength": 40
      }
    }
  },
  "data": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "properties": {
      "records": {
        "type": "array",
        "maxItems": 200,
        "items": {
          "type": "object"
        }
      },
      "quota": {
        "type": "object"
      },
      "total": {
        "type": "number"
      },
      "truncated": {
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    }
  },
  "text": {
